COMPILATION OF: E48A8

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48A8

   1 a 0000 E48A8:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1] `b = (k ^= 0)'.  `^=' is DR's ASCII spelling of
   4 a 0006      NOT-EQUAL and its skip byte is the [C072] CA defect in every
   5 a 0006      context measured so far (integer var/literal, DEC, mod).  A
   6 a 0006      materialising `^=' has no sample: does the defect travel? */
   7 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   8 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
   9 c 0006   k = 3;
  10 c 000C   b = (k ^= 0);
  11 c 0018   put list('R=', b);
  12 c 003A   stop;
  13 a 003D end E48A8;

CODE SIZE = 003D
DATA AREA = 0005
FREE SYMS = 38A3
END  COMPILATION
